# ElenaAI — Voice Onboarding for Ugosti.me Hosts

**BizHack 2026 · Challenge 05 · Ugosti.me**

> Hosts don't fill in a single form. Elena, an AI assistant, starts the conversation, asks one question at a time, and the host answers mostly by voice. Everything that can be found online (Booking, Airbnb, Google) Elena pulls in herself. The host only confirms ("Yes, that's my place") and adds what can't be found: price, bank account, registration licence and calendar link.

