## 1. The problem

Ugosti.me gets plenty of traffic but very few hosts with complete listings:

| Funnel step | Rate (Aug 2025 – Nov 2026) |
|---|---|
| Visit → registration | 11.3% |
| Registration → complete listing | 1.1% |

Many hosts in Montenegro are small, private and not very active online. They already get guests through Booking.com and Airbnb, so a new platform with a long registration form feels like extra work with an uncertain return.

