## 7. How Ugosti.me keeps using it
- Built on tools Ugosti.me can run itself (Supabase, n8n, ElevenLabs, Apify), and Elena is already the name of Ugosti.me's AI
- Fields are mapped to the existing Ugosti.me data model (User → Host → Location → Units)
- Cost per onboarded host is measured from day one (`usage_log`)
- Next steps: direct API import into Ugosti.me, reminders for skipped steps, more languages and markets

## 8. Data, privacy and open questions
- Only anonymised or made-up data is in this repository
- Sensitive data (bank account, personal ID, licence) is stored in private storage, and each user only sees their own data (Supabase row-level security)
- **Business model:** the guest pays an 8% fee on top. The host keeps the full price they set.
- **Later:** reusing photos and reviews from other platforms at scale. For the first version, the host confirms in the preview that the photos are their own.

